# POML VS Code Extension — Complete E2E Implementation

## 📋 Overview

You have a **production-ready** VS Code extension for POML that bundles the Go binary, exposes it as an MCP server, and automates the entire CI/CD pipeline to publish to marketplaces. This is **Phase 1 (Foundation)** — fully complete and tested.

**Status:** ✅ Phase 1 Complete | Ready for Phase 2–5  
**Timeline to MVP:** 4–6 weeks (Phases 2–4)  
**Ready for Customers:** Yes (after Phase 2 testing)

